{'symbol': 'SYF', 'date': '2021-04-22 16:44:00', 'title': 'SYNCHRONY ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND OF $0.22 PER SHARE', 'text': 'STAMFORD, CONN., APRIL 22, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SYNCHRONY FINANCIAL (NYSE: SYF) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.22 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE ON MAY 13, 2021 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MAY 3, 2021.'}